	<section_number>46.2-486</section_number>
	<catch_line>Governor to be "executive head" within meaning of compact</catch_line>
	<text>
		As used in the compact, with reference to the Commonwealth, the term "executive head" shall mean the Governor.
	</text>
	<history>1968, c. 166, § 46.1-167.11; 1989, c. 727 .</history>
